sfp-plus-mod is an open hardware SFP+
breakout module board published by Lightside Instruments AS.

Up to release sfp-plus-mod-1.3 the project provided schematics and
PCB design files for KiCAD. Since sfp-plus-mod-1.3-1
OpenSCAD design of a 3d printable mechanical enclosure conforming
with minor exceptions to SFF-8432 Rev 5.2a
was added - mechanical.scad.

The project is published by Lightside Instruments AS
under TAPR Open Hardware License. Read the LICENSE file
for details.
